Usage: amortise [--csv] PRINCIPAL ANNUAL-RATE MONTHS
 
Prints the monthly repayment schedule for a loan.
 
  PRINCIPAL    amount borrowed, e.g. 250000 or 250000.00
  ANNUAL-RATE  nominal yearly interest rate in percent, e.g. 11.75
  MONTHS       term in months, 1 to 600
  --csv        print the schedule as CSV instead of a report
[exit 0]
